  m_text: '<size=42><b>Simulator Controls</b></size>\n<size=22><color=#B9C7D8>Use these controls to interact in VR</color></size>\n\n<size=22><color=#9EDCFF>[WASD]</color>  <b>Move</b></size>\n<size=18><color=#B9C7D8>Move around the venue</color></size>\n\n<size=22><color=#9EDCFF>[RMB + Mouse]</color>  <b>Look</b></size>\n<size=18><color=#B9C7D8>Look around</color></size>\n\n<size=22><color=#9EDCFF>[Tab]</color>  <b>Switch Head / Controller</b></size>\n<size=18><color=#B9C7D8>Toggle between headset and simulated controller</color></size>\n\n<size=22><color=#9EDCFF>[G]</color>  <b>Grab / Release</b></size>\n<size=18><color=#B9C7D8>Grab and move objects</color></size>\n\n<size=22><color=#9EDCFF>[T]</color>  <b>Select / Trigger</b></size>\n<size=18><color=#B9C7D8>Select or interact with UI and objects</color></size>'
